  "source": "ade20k_scene_parse_150",
  "notes": [
    "Maps every ADE20K-150 class index to a project class and type.",
    "type=ignore means the pixel casts no vote (treated as unlabeled evidence).",
    "ADE20K has no railroad-track class; train-scene tracks will fall into",
    "ground/road and must stay covered by the GroundingDINO route in fill mode.",
    "tree stays a thing class to match the accepted instance-ID convention;",
    "grass/plant/palm/flower merge into stuff vegetation, matching semantic_palette."
